        "headline": "Flood Warning issued August 7 at 11:00AM AKDT until August 8 at 1:00PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...Flooding caused by excessive rainfall continues.\n\n* WHERE...Yentna River including Lake Creek.\n\n* WHEN...Until 100 PM AKDT Saturday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Flooding of rivers, creeks, streams, and other low-lying\nand flood-prone locations is occurring.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- At 1053 AM AKDT, the river remains in moderate flood stage\nafter heavy rains earlier this week, but is beginning to\nsubside. The river crested at 22.52 ft around 8pm Thursday,\nAugust 7th.\n- For Yentna River at Lake Creek:",
